WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.740
Turned, it becomes a model.

00:02.469 --> 00:04.489
Off our line a model takes over.

00:05.080 --> 00:15.114
Where its stars lie on the sky comes from the Gaia spacecraft's counts; how far each sits in front or behind is a guess, as no single star's depth can be measured.
